# Project Name
PES Freight Scheduling 

## Description
take home test for Carbon 5

## Scripts

- `start`: Runs the compiled server code using Node.js.
    ```sh
    npm run start
    ```

- `dev`: Runs the server in development mode using `nodemon` and `ts-node`. It watches for changes in TypeScript files and restarts the server automatically.
    ```sh
    npm run dev
    ```

- `build`: Compiles the TypeScript code to JavaScript using the TypeScript compiler (`tsc`).
    ```sh
    npm run build
    ```

- `test`: Runs the tests using Jest with the configuration specified in `jest.config.ts`.
    ```sh
    npm run test
    ```